    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>初陽之黄金兔[初陽の黄金兎</b>，初陽の黄金兎<b>]</b>\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/38/Aurelia_qbub.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230107032253\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Aurelia qbub\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"613\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Aurelia qbub.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Aurelia_qbub.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/38/Aurelia_qbub.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230107032253\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>一位拥有令人迷醉的外貌和姿态的女子。她的真实身份是一只妖兔，化为人形，只为寻找强大的伴侣以繁衍后代。她如阳光般闪耀，金色长发飘动，跃动战斗，运用野兽般的本能。\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"1a110af5a4c0851439f73c8024d35112\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Aurelia_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:76px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Aurelia_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Aurelia Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (328 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:76px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/0/00/Aurelia_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/76?cb=20250202234859\" title=\"Aurelia Queen&#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (328 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"1